1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,520
Sometimes the heart needs more time to accept what the mind already knows.

2
00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:11,940
The mind moves on the day it understands. The heart moves on the day it stops hoping.

3
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:18,860
And between those two days, a person lives an entire life pretending to be fine.
